WEBVTT

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.010
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.010
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.710
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.710
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:50.580
DAI AND PRINCESS LEONA

00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:54.550
Are you Dai, the Hero?

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:55.730
Yep!

00:01:55.730 --> 00:02:00.140
Oh wow, you're so tiny!
Talk about undependable!

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:07.290
The royal family of our Papnica Kingdom
has long served the gods.

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:12.610
The latest successor, Princess Leona,
during the month of her 14th birthday,

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:17.650
must partake in a ritual to receive
the blessing of the Earth God.

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:20.490
This island has
a cave into the earth, yes?

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:24.120
Indeed. There is a gigantic cave here.

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:26.540
That is the Ritual Land we seek.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:32.190
But, as this island has long been feared
as an island of monsters,

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:34.310
no one knows where it is.

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:39.110
It's been 50 years since a member of
the royal family has undergone the ritual.

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:42.910
It just so happened,
when King Romos visited Papnica,

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:47.660
he spoke of Dai the Future Hero
and Brass the Venerable.

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:52.920
I see. So you would like Dai
to take you to the Earth Cave.

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:53.620
Huh?!

00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:58.800
The monsters of Dermline Island
will obey Dai, will they not?

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:01.910
The Earth Cave is a dangerous place.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.870
To take the Princess there...

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:08.250
Princess Leona will one day become a Sage.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:13.310
With the magic I have taught her,
there will be no danger.

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:14.830
Hmm.

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:19.440
Grampa, I don't wanna. She seems rude.

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:20.820
Watch your mouth!

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:21.760
Ow!

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:26.450
If he will be useful,
I will gladly lend him to you.

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:27.260
Go on!

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:32.850
Is this really safe?
Are you sure you won't get lost?

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:40.920
This island is my backyard!
I can walk around it blindfolded!

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:41.880
Oh!

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:43.410
How brave!

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:44.620
Hmph!

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:50.450
Let's go. It's that way.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.480
Take good care of the Princess.

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:58.090
I understand.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:07.510
What's wrong?

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.640
Oh. It's you.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:16.360
Hey, don't sleep here. Get out of the way.

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.490
Bye!

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:28.340
Wow! Amazing!
I'm actually impressed, little boy.

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:29.620
It's Dai.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:32.580
Is there anything else you can do?

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:34.120
Like magic?

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.440
I can't do magic.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:40.840
Huh? Seriously?! Not a single spell?!

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:42.720
Princess...

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:47.220
I'm sure Sir Dai just hasn't
undergone a Ritual of Magic yet.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:49.970
I did the rituals.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:58.290
Grampa wants me to be a Mage, so we did
Rituals of Magic for lots of spells.

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:01.460
Huh. So you've already bound with spells.

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:05.200
But I still can't use a single spell.

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:07.280
I don't have the talent.

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:12.810
So this is the Earth Cave.

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:14.120
It's impressive.

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:16.060
Prepare for the ritual!

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:16.930
Yes, sir!

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:18.630
I'm going to have a look around.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:28.780
What?!

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:31.200
You can have this.

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:35.330
It's a distinguished knife
of the Papnica royal family.

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:38.770
But Temjin gets mad
when I carry it around.

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:45.690
This is amazing!

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:54.080
If you can't use magic,
you might as well have a decent weapon.

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:58.500
Don't be so gloomy
and work on your sword skills!

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:03.940
You really don't hold anything back,
do you?

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:07.780
Of course.
It's better for everyone that way.

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:09.800
Plus it makes me feel better.

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:15.330
You didn't try to spare
my feelings either.

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:17.270
Huh? That was...

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:18.600
I guess so.

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:23.190
Gush!

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:33.390
An Evil Scorpion?!

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:36.470
Isn't that your friend?! Get it to leave!

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:39.750
No! That's not a creature
from this island!

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:41.350
Everyone run!

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:43.000
Protect the Princess!

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:45.840
It's like a rock!

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:54.050
Hold on!

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:57.060
Look out!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:06:59.020
Sizz!

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.360
Magic doesn't work?!

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:12.870
Princess Leona!

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:25.090
This knife is amazing!

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.520
Your weak point is...

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:44.150
right there!

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:01.500
Princess Leona!

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.810
It's the Evil Scorpion's poison!

00:08:08.810 --> 00:08:11.880
Grampa said even
an Antidotal Herb can't cure it!

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:17.070
Gomechan! Hurry and call Grampa Brass!

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:20.390
Grampa can use
the cure poison spell, Squelch!

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.240
Hang in there Princess Leona!

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:34.320
She's gonna die at this rate!

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:38.450
Darn it! I should've worked on
learning magic harder!

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:41.910
Varon!

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.830
Thank goodness!
Cast Squelch on the Princess!

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.020
A Magic Cylinder!

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:49.800
Princess Leona...

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:52.800
dies here!

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:54.470
Bang!

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:03.100
And never come out!

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:10.040
Dai washed ashore here as a baby.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:16.360
Since then, he's grown up among us.
So everyone is his friend...

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:20.200
What?!

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:30.210
Princess Leona has been poisoned
by an Evil Scorpion! We must go save her!

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:35.150
How could an Evil Scorpion show up here?

00:09:35.150 --> 00:09:37.630
I need to hurry and cast Squelch on her!

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:39.660
What's the meaning of this?!

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:45.390
If you save the Princess,
all of my plans will have been for naught.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:47.200
What?!

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:49.620
If Princess Leona dies,

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:54.940
without a successor,
Papnica Kingdom will be mine to rule!

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:58.320
That's why I went ahead with this ritual!

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:05.290
So I could say she was killed
by the monsters of Dermline Island!

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:10.420
You were all in on this?!

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:17.380
Only these seven of my trusted servants
and Varon know about this.

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:19.530
Frizz!

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:20.680
Frizz!

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:26.430
Gome, summon everyone!
Let's drive them off of this island!

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:37.400
What's that?

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:52.290
Darn it! Another dead end!

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:04.450
You're a servant of the gods, yet
you would kill your master out of greed?!

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:06.100
Unforgivable!

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:14.480
Gush.

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:25.260
Ah! The Killing Machine!

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:32.230
Impossible! The Dark Lord created
the Killing Machine to kill the Hero!

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:34.790
How can it move with the Dark Lord dead?!

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:38.340
<i>Here's your answer, old man!</i>

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:44.320
Varon's magic power is driving it?!

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:45.610
That's right.

00:11:45.610 --> 00:11:51.830
I modified this abomination after it was
nothing more than junk from the last war.

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:56.540
So that it could be controlled
by a human's will!

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:58.150
How could you?!

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:03.490
You're now the ultimate creature!
Wipe them out, Varon!

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.280
Everyone get back!

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:25.720
Frizzle!

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:29.970
Did it work?!

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:34.900
<i>Old fool!</i>

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:42.190
This Killing Machine was created
to exterminate the Hero!

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:46.870
Your pitiful magic can't harm it!

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:58.590
GUSH/GULP

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.590
BOOM
EXPLOSION-TYPE SPELL

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:06.260
Dai...

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:09.390
Princess Leona!

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:15.450
Where are we?

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:19.060
We're underground.
We fell in the gigantic cave.

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:21.790
In the cave?

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:24.000
If I had more strength...

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:27.910
If I could use magic, I could heal you.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:31.790
I could even get us out of here.

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:33.810
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:35.290
Did you know?

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:40.540
Most people can't even bind with magic.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.230
Princess Leona...

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:47.340
You've bound
with almost every spell, right?

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:51.490
That's proof you have talent.

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:52.850
But I...

00:13:54.310 --> 00:14:00.190
I know you'll learn to use magic someday.

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:01.480
Leona!

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:07.360
If you keep whining,
I won't like you anymore.

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:11.990
Leona! Don't die! Leona!

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:17.290
You won't die.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:20.170
I swear you'll live!

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:26.380
I won't let you die!

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:43.270
What was that shockwave?!

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:53.780
There you are, old man!

00:14:58.210 --> 00:14:59.560
This is goodbye!

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:00.710
Stop!

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:02.920
Grampa!

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:04.130
Dai?!

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:09.740
Varon, the Princess still lives!

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:10.800
That little brat!

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:14.220
What is that?!

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:15.930
<i>Die!</i>

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:26.040
Dai, run! They were planning
to kill Princess Leona!

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:27.540
I can't Grampa!

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:31.170
The poison has already
spread through her body!

00:15:31.170 --> 00:15:34.030
She needs a Squelch spell or she'll die!

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:35.470
What?!

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:39.120
Varon, hurry and kill that old man!

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:43.750
That way no one will be able
to save the Princess!

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:47.920
Grampa!

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:51.510
The Princess is sure to die now!

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:05.270
Kaswoosh!

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:14.320
D-Dai used magic?!

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:16.470
Grampa, are you okay?!

00:16:16.470 --> 00:16:17.910
Y-Yes!

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:26.150
You startled me!

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:28.090
Even Kaswoosh doesn't work?!

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:31.050
<i>I'm going to kill...</i>

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.720
all of you!

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:35.390
Stop!

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:38.490
I won't let you rampage
on this island any more!

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:41.310
Don't make me laugh, boy!

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:08.170
Little fool! Your efforts are futile!

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:14.530
<i>Magic doesn't work! And you
lack the strength to win with a sword!</i>

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:18.510
There's no way for you to beat me!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.450
Dai!

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:38.620
It's over.

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:43.700
Die!

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:57.590
Impossible! He pierced
the Killing Machine's armour?!

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:04.060
<i>He's been targeting the same spot?!</i>

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:07.190
What is that?!

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:17.950
Curse you!

00:18:26.210 --> 00:18:27.620
Sizzle!

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:47.230
Why?! The Killing Machine
is immune to magic!

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:51.000
There was a crack
in the Killing Machine's armour.

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:55.570
The flames of the Sizzle spell
leaked in and hit Varon.

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:01.160
Grampa!

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:02.220
Help Leona!

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:03.330
R-Right!

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:06.930
Bishop Temjin!

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:09.250
What is going on?!

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:12.850
Tell them the truth!

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:13.960
You brat...

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:17.650
Everyone! This boy took the Princess...

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:20.010
What about me, Temjin?

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:26.430
Are you alright, Princess?!

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:32.750
If you have something to say, say it.

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:35.110
It'll make you feel better.

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:38.740
Let a judge at Papnica hear it, too.

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:46.800
Earth God,

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:51.020
I, Leona, priestess
and successor of Papnica Kingdom

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:53.640
come before you to be purified.

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:56.810
So Leona really is a Princess.

00:19:56.810 --> 00:19:58.380
Be quiet!

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:01.930
I pledge myself to the Earth God.

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:16.420
Thank you, Dai. You saved my life.

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:19.380
I'm glad you're okay, Princess Leona.

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:22.200
Have you gained some confidence in magic?

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:24.200
I guess so.

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:28.550
When you eventually become a Hero,
come to Papnica.

00:20:28.550 --> 00:20:31.680
I'll let you be my bodyguard or something.

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:34.460
Uh... No thanks!

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:38.130
Farewell, Princess!

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:42.630
It's "Leona," not "Princess!"

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:43.860
But...

00:20:43.860 --> 00:20:48.970
Next time you treat me like a stranger,
I won't speak to you!

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:56.310
Goodbye, Leona!

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:58.170
See you!

00:20:58.170 --> 00:20:59.650
Listen, Dai.

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:02.670
Could you do that again?

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:03.670
That?

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:05.380
That Kaswoosh and all.

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:06.550
Okay!

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:07.950
Kaswoosh!

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:09.970
Sizzle!

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:13.210
Perhaps I was seeing things.

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:18.500
Monsters are attacking!

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:24.610
What is that?!

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:26.450
Master, this is bad!

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:28.260
This is bad, Master!

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:32.080
Tons of monsters
just showed up in the city!

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:34.370
-What a pickle.
-Huh?

00:21:34.370 --> 00:21:37.900
I didn't think the Dark Lord would return.

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:40.630
Wait. That's all?!

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:42.690
Shouldn't we go back
and take care of them?!

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:47.030
The soldiers can handle those monsters.

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:50.050
We must aim for the future.

00:21:50.050 --> 00:21:51.140
The future?

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:56.120
Now that the Dark Lord has returned,
the people will need a Hero.

00:21:57.170 --> 00:21:59.540
Let us go visit the new Hero.

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:25.940
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:25.940
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:36.160
<i>I'm not sure</i>

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:36.160
<i>doudarou</i>

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:44.130
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:44.130
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:46.670
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:46.670
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:52.810
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:52.810
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:57.480
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:57.480
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:01.690
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:01.690
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:08.150
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:08.150
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:13.990
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:13.990
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:19.290
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:19.290
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:37.020
<i>When a terrible calamity
threatens Dermline Island,</i>

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:40.810
<i>a man calling himself a tutor
appears before Dai.</i>

00:23:41.560 --> 00:23:44.110
<i>To save the island and the world,</i>

00:23:44.270 --> 00:23:46.610
<i>together with
Popp the young Mage trainee,</i>

00:23:47.360 --> 00:23:51.280
<i>Dai decides to undertake
a special hard training!</i>

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:55.700
<i>Next time on</i>
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:55.870 --> 00:23:57.910
<i>"The Hero's Tutor"</i>

00:23:58.080 --> 00:24:00.000
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
